    "case_for": "Optical lattice clocks turned precision timekeeping into a powerful experimental tool for probing fundamental physics. Katori and Ye made complementary advances, and the approach has been independently realized and refined over decades. Its lasting scientific value rests on demonstrated measurement capability, not on future applications alone.",
    "case_against": "The boundary between the foundational clock advances and later improvements by a broad community needs careful historical review. The field continues to advance, so the award should recognize the established core rather than imply credit for every subsequent gain in precision.",
